[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1811921106","pull_request_review_id":2387274462,"id":1811921106,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5r_7jS","diff_hunk":"@@ -249,7 +249,7 @@ enum class Key {\n \n enum class KeyModifierMask {\n \tCODE_MASK = ((1 << 23) - 1), ///< Apply this mask to any keycode to remove modifiers.\n-\tMODIFIER_MASK = (0x7F << 22), ///< Apply this mask to isolate modifiers.\n+\tMODIFIER_MASK = (0x7E << 22), ///< Apply this mask to isolate modifiers.","path":"core/os/keyboard.h","commit_id":"0153cb8c16380c32a1d555fb3e54feb5a79e4126","original_commit_id":"3c6f92630916531fec5da948aaaecc7955237b6f","user":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"```suggestion\r\n\tMODIFIER_MASK = (0x1FF << 23), ///< Apply this mask to isolate modifiers.\r\n```\r\n\r\nCurrently the upper 9 bits are reserved for modifiers (see #98447).\r\nIf we want to break API compatibility with this change (which I believe, we should in order to fix this API-bug), then we should include the complete range of valid modifiers, so that we don't need to change it again.","created_at":"2024-10-23T05:52:44Z","updated_at":"2024-10-23T06:09:11Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98441#discussion_r1811921106","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98441","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1811921106"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98441#discussion_r1811921106"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98441"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1811921106/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":252,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":5,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1812143234","pull_request_review_id":2387677140,"id":1812143234,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5sAxyC","diff_hunk":"@@ -249,7 +249,7 @@ enum class Key {\n \n enum class KeyModifierMask {\n \tCODE_MASK = ((1 << 23) - 1), ///< Apply this mask to any keycode to remove modifiers.\n-\tMODIFIER_MASK = (0x7F << 22), ///< Apply this mask to isolate modifiers.\n+\tMODIFIER_MASK = (0x7E << 22), ///< Apply this mask to isolate modifiers.","path":"core/os/keyboard.h","commit_id":"0153cb8c16380c32a1d555fb3e54feb5a79e4126","original_commit_id":"3c6f92630916531fec5da948aaaecc7955237b6f","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"> Currently the upper 9 bits are reserved for modifiers\r\n\r\nNot sure if `KPAD` and `GROUP_SWITCH` should be considered modifiers.\r\n\r\nBut both seems to be unused:\r\n- `GROUP_SWITCH` flag seems to be completely unused (I have no idea what it was intended for).\r\n- `KPAD` flag is parsed by macOS native menu code, but it must an oversight, since it's never set by any code.\r\n\r\nI would probably mask it like this:\r\n\r\n```\r\n0-20  Unicode value       |1|\r\n21    Reserved            |1| CODE_MASK\r\n22    Special key flag    |1|\r\n23    Reserved                 |2| Keep reserved in case we want to add some other special flag.\r\n24    CTRL or CMD flag              |3|\r\n25    SHIFT flag                    |3|\r\n26    ALT flag                      |3|\r\n27    META flag                     |3| MODIFIER_MASK\r\n28    CTRL flag                     |3|\r\n29    (KPAD) Reserved               |3|\r\n30    (GROUP_SWITCH) Reserved       |3|\r\n31    Reserved                           |4| Sign bit, keep clean to avoid negative values if it's used with int32_t API.\r\n```","created_at":"2024-10-23T08:11:47Z","updated_at":"2024-10-23T08:11:47Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98441#discussion_r1812143234","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98441","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1812143234"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98441#discussion_r1812143234"},